00:17:46,148 --> 00:17:47,248
[SPEAKER_00]: Why haven't you seen that?

273
00:17:51,329 --> 00:17:52,369
[SPEAKER_00]: Well, that's a beginningless.

274
00:17:52,709 --> 00:17:54,309
[SPEAKER_00]: Because... because it is ignorance.

275
00:17:54,949 --> 00:17:56,270
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah, but why is ignorance still there?

276
00:17:58,490 --> 00:18:01,351
[SPEAKER_01]: Ignorance is beginningless, but ignorance remaining there... Yeah, yeah, yeah.

277
00:18:01,371 --> 00:18:03,971
[SPEAKER_01]: ...is, you know, it's not that you can't do anything about it.

278
00:18:05,192 --> 00:18:07,552
[SPEAKER_00]: So, why is there nothing done about it?

279
00:18:08,712 --> 00:18:11,153
[SPEAKER_01]: Again, don't leave the basis of feeling that we're talking about.

280
00:18:11,173 --> 00:18:11,873
[SPEAKER_01]: The answer is there.

281
00:18:16,555 --> 00:18:20,977
