285
00:18:32,761 --> 00:18:34,162
[SPEAKER_00]: By the unpleasantness.

286
00:18:34,182 --> 00:18:36,062
[SPEAKER_01]: Is that what you mean?

287
00:18:36,563 --> 00:18:41,484
[SPEAKER_01]: Well, sort of, but even more accurately, how do you know that feeling pressured you?

288
00:18:43,685 --> 00:18:45,386
[SPEAKER_01]: Or, how can feeling pressure you?

289
00:18:51,553 --> 00:18:52,453
[SPEAKER_00]: Because you're bothered by it.

