[SPEAKER_01]: Exactly.

301
00:19:21,180 --> 00:19:33,484
[SPEAKER_01]: So, literally, if we boil down everything we've been saying in the last few talks regarding this topic, it all comes down to not knowing how to allow there is a feeling to endure on its own.

302
00:19:33,524 --> 00:19:33,844
[SPEAKER_00]: On its own.

303
00:19:33,924 --> 00:19:35,865
[SPEAKER_00]: Because that is its nature.

304
00:19:37,086 --> 00:19:37,286
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah.

305
00:19:37,786 --> 00:19:43,388
[SPEAKER_00]: And so, whenever you do anything to withstand that

