00:21:13,173 --> 00:21:13,573
[SPEAKER_01]: Exactly.

337
00:21:13,593 --> 00:21:16,275
[SPEAKER_01]: How not to interfere with your recent feeling.

338
00:21:16,395 --> 00:21:20,858
[SPEAKER_01]: And he knows how to endure the endurance of feelings.

339
00:21:20,878 --> 00:21:25,581
[SPEAKER_01]: So, be mindful of the feeling that's enduring.

